---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro';
---

<StarlightPage frontmatter={{
  template: 'splash',
  title: 'MTA:SA Neon',
  description: 'Technical documentation for the engine systems and Lua APIs added by MTA:SA Neon.',
  tableOfContents: false,
}}>
  <main class="gateway">
    <div class="road-mark" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p class="gateway-kicker">CUSTOM ENGINE · DOCUMENTED FROM SOURCE</p>
    <h2>MTA:SA <span>NEON</span></h2>
    <p class="gateway-lead">Extended-world systems, native GTA services, compatibility contracts, and every Lua API introduced or extended by Neon.</p>

    <div class="gateway-actions">
      <a class="primary" href="/neon">Enter Neon documentation <span>→</span></a>
      <a href="/neon/functions">Browse all 76 API entries</a>
    </div>

    <div class="gateway-grid">
      <div><strong>76</strong><span>documented API entries</span></div>
      <div><strong>08</strong><span>system guides</span></div>
      <div><strong>100%</strong><span>Neon-specific content</span></div>
    </div>

    <aside class="official-link">
      <div><span>STANDARD MTA REFERENCE</span><strong>Looking for the official MTA API?</strong></div>
      <a href="https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/Main_Page">Open the official MTA Wiki ↗</a>
    </aside>

    <p class="gateway-disclaimer">MTA:SA Neon is an independent experimental fork. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Multi Theft Auto team.</p>
  </main>
</StarlightPage>

<style>
  .gateway { position: relative; max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6.5rem) 1rem; overflow: hidden; }
  .road-mark { position: absolute; z-index: -1; top: 1rem; right: 8%; width: 7rem; height: 36rem; opacity: .12; transform: rotate(32deg); background: repeating-linear-gradient(180deg, #f28c18 0 3.6rem, transparent 3.6rem 6.4rem); }
  .gateway-kicker { margin: 0; color: #f28c18; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .24em; }
  h2 { max-width: 10ch; margin: 1rem 0; color: #f3eadc; font-size: clamp(4.4rem, 13vw, 10rem); line-height: .78; letter-spacing: -.025em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h2 span { display: block; color: #f28c18; text-shadow: .08em .08em 0 #512506; }
  .gateway-lead { max-width: 48rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.3rem); }
  .gateway-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin: 2rem 0 3rem; }
  .gateway-actions a { padding: .85rem 1.1rem; color: #f3eadc; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #4d3a28; background: #12100e; }
  .gateway-actions a:hover { border-color: #f28c18; transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .gateway-actions .primary { color: #0a0806; font-weight: 900; background: #f28c18; border-color: #f28c18; box-shadow: .3rem .3rem 0 #5b2a06; }
  .gateway-actions .primary span { margin-left: .5rem; }
  .gateway-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); max-width: 52rem; border-top: 1px solid #4d3a28; border-bottom: 1px solid #4d3a28; }
  .gateway-grid div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 1.25rem; border-right: 1px solid #4d3a28; }
  .gateway-grid div:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .gateway-grid strong { color: #f28c18; font-family: Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .gateway-grid span { color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); font-size: .75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .07em; }
  .official-link { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 3rem; padding: 1.3rem 1.5rem; border-left: 5px solid #f28c18; background: #17130f; }
  .official-link div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .official-link span { color: #f28c18; font-size: .62rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .16em; }
  .official-link a { color: #ffb454; font-weight: 800; white-space: nowrap; }
  .gateway-disclaimer { margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); font-size: .82rem; }
  @media (max-width: 650px) { .gateway-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .gateway-grid div { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #4d3a28; } .gateway-grid div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; } .official-link { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: .8rem; } .official-link a { white-space: normal; } }
</style>
